{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"一、二十有七年，春，公會〈木巳〉伯姬于洮。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"二、夏六月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、鄭伯，同盟于幽。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"三、秋，公子友如陳葬原仲。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"原仲者何？陳大夫也。大夫不書葬，此何以書？通乎季子之私行也。何通乎季子之私行？辟內難也。君子辟內難而不辟外難。內難者何？公子慶父、公子牙、公子友皆莊公之母弟也。公子慶父、公子牙通乎夫人，以脅公，季子起而治之，則不得與于國政，坐而視之則親親。因不忍見也，故於是復請至于陳，而葬原仲也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"四、冬，〈木巳〉伯姬來。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"其言來何？直來曰來，大歸曰來歸。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"五、莒慶來逆叔姬。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"莒慶者何？莒大夫也。莒無大夫，此何以書？譏。何譏爾？大夫越竟逆女，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"六、〈木巳〉伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_56_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_56","textTraditional":"七、公會齊侯于城濮。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}